"text": "You are wearing the Air Emerald cardigan, light blue jeans, and beige boots, paired with a golden pendant necklace, a milky scarf, and a Rockstud clutch. The outfit works as a balanced celebration look for your winter evening: the soft green of the top and bag echo your skin tone and eye color while the neutral blues, beiges, and milky white anchor you in the cool frosty air. It complements your X figure by drawing a vertical line from shoulder to ankle through the fitted top and straight jeans, letting your defined waist shine. The golden metal and green accents bring warmth to your look without competing with your hair or eyes.",
"how_to_wear": [
"wear the milky scarf loosely around your neck to let the cardigan’s neckline breathe while keeping a cozy layer for the frost",
"keep the clutch at hand as a sleek evening detail that matches your green top for a seamless color block",
"wear the pendant close to your collarbone to frame your face and tie the neutral tones of your outfit together"]
